content.text:
Confirmed: line 87-128 is a diagnostic block with `cudaDeviceSynchronize()` at line 89, and line 131-? another with sync at 133. This IS the 9B swiglu path (used by our model), and it's ungated → root cause of graph capture failure.

Fix: gate both blocks with `if constexpr (false)`.

Edit 1: line 87 `    {` → `    if constexpr (false) {` (anchor includes the comment line 88).
Edit 2: line 131 `    {` → `    if constexpr (false) {` (anchor includes comment at 132).

Anchors must be unique. Use:
```
    {
        // [9B 排障] launch 是异步的 —— 必须先同步再 dump，否则读到未写完的数据
        cudaDeviceSynchronize();
```
and
```
    {
        // [9B 排障] 逐元素对比 gate/up/out 的原始 bits（找第一个不一致）
        cudaDeviceSynchronize();
```

Apply both, build, test graph. This is the decisive fix.

Context is nearly gone; do the 2 edits + build + bench in as few calls as possible: 2 edits, then one combined build+bench call.

